<title>GERMANY: Altana to issue statement on market rumours.</title>
<headline>Altana to issue statement on market rumours.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceutical group Altana AG said on Wednesday it planned to make a statement to clarify market rumours responsible for sending the group's shares up five percent in bourse trade.</p>
<p>The company said it would make the statement at 1500 GMT.</p>
<p>Shares, extending Tuesday's sharp post-bourse rise, on Wednesday climbed as much as 7.6 percent during bourse trade.</p>
